"description":"Skip-Bo™: Solitaire Card Game is now officially on mobile! Brought to you by the creators of UNO! and Phase 10, this classic board card game offers a fun and competitive experience designed for every card game lover.\n\nThis new take on the classic solitaire card games will get you hooked and you won't be able to stop playing!\nSimilar to Rummy and Yahtzee, Skip-Bo™ requires players to think strategically to solve problems. With its simple rules and engaging gameplay, it has become a tycoon in the world of card and board games, enjoyed by players of all ages and skill levels.\n\n▶ ▶ Classic for a reason!◀◀\nSkip-Bo™: Solitaire Card Game is a fan-favorite and loved by millions around the world. Now you can play the official Skip-Bo solitaire card game just the way you remember! It’s the perfect digital board game experience, offering everything from intense 2 player battles to group matches. Play offline anywhere at all, or challenge real opponents in our online mode! Skip-Bo™: Solitaire Card Game has fun in spades.\n\n▶ ▶ Play and explore!◀◀\nThere are hundreds of levels just waiting for you to beat! Cruise through a richly illustrated world as you clear levels and progress through the maps. Harvest bundles of coins along the way! In this farm adventure mode, challenge friends in 2 player matches or compete online. It's the ultimate board game and solitaire showtime!\n\n▶ ▶ Customize your adventure! ◀◀\nWhether you’re new to Skip-Bo™, a loyal fan, a solitaire player, or just need a refresher, we have levels for everyone! New levels are added regularly and will challenge your skills in this strategic and fun board card game. Clear the pyramid of Stock cards to win!\n\n▶ ▶ Download and play for free today!◀◀\nLike Mattel's other iconic brands Barbie, UNO and Phase 10, Skip-bo has been a source of joy for many players over the years. Download now to relive the fun online with friends and families anytime, anywhere!\n\nFollow us for more updates.\nFaceboo